      },
      "justification": "MANDATORY: Urine output monitoring (target 0.5 ml/kg/h) is the primary endpoint for guiding fluid resuscitation in burn patients. Foley is already in place \u2014 must now actively monitor output to ensure adequate but not excessive resuscitation."
    },
    {
      "action_id": "titrate_fluids_to_urine_output",
